---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Section from '@csss-site-events/ui/components/Section.astro';
import Button from '@csss-site-events/ui/components/Button.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site.data';
import Faq from '../components/Faq.astro';
import DiscordIcon from '@csss-site-events/ui/icons/DiscordIcon.astro';
import CsssIcon from '@csss-site-events/ui/icons/CsssIcon.astro';
import commonData from '@csss-site-events/ui/common.data';
---

<Layout title="Frosh 2026">
  <div slot="hero">Hero</div>
  <Section id="about" title="What's a Frosh?">
    <strong>Frosh Week</strong> is a series of events run by the Computing Science Student Society at
    Simon Fraser University in collaboration with the School of Computing Science.
    <br />
    <br />
    Frosh Week occurs during the fall semester to welcome <strong>
      300+ new undergraduate students
    </strong> into the School of Computing Science with the help of 80+ volunteers. Starting a degree
    is a pivotal moment in a student's academic journey, and Frosh Week helps forge lasting memories and
    strong friendships.
    <br />
    <br />
    {siteConfig.eventName} continues this tradition, running from <strong
      >{siteConfig.startDate}th</strong
    > to <strong>{siteConfig.endDate}th</strong>. This year's Frosh is inspired by TODO.
    <Fragment slot="footer">
      <Button href="/registration" variant="solid">Register</Button>
      <Button href="/registration" variant="solid">Waiver</Button>
    </Fragment>
  </Section>
  <Section title="Who's organizing this?">
    The SFU <strong>Computing Science Student Society (CSSS)</strong> is a student-led organization supporting
    over
    <strong>2,500 undergraduate computing science students</strong> at Simon Fraser University. All SFU
    students—whether majoring, minoring, or just taking a computing science course—are automatically members.
    Everyone is welcome to get involved!
    <br />
    <br />
    We organize <strong>two annual hackathons</strong>, a <strong>Silicon Valley trip</strong>, and
    career-focused events like career fairs, company tours, and workshops. We also host <strong
      >bi-weekly board game nights</strong
    >, <strong>hikes</strong>, <strong>seasonal parties</strong>, and more!
    <Fragment slot="footer">
      <Button href={commonData.discordHref} variant="solid"><DiscordIcon />Discord</Button>
      <Button href="/registration" variant="solid"><CsssIcon />Waiver</Button>
    </Fragment>
  </Section>
  <Section id="schedule" title="Schedule">
    <strong>{siteConfig.eventName}</strong> is happening over 5 days (and one night) from <strong
      >{siteConfig.startDate}</strong
    > to <strong>{siteConfig.endDate}</strong>
    <br />
    <br />
    There's something for everyone at Frosh, so we hope to see you at as many events as possible! If there
    are any changes in the schedule, we will notify everyone through <strong>email</strong> and <strong
      >announcements on Discord</strong
    >, so make sure you've signed up or joined the server.
    <br />
    <br />
    Here's a summary of what's to come:
  </Section>
  <Section id="sponsors" title="Sponsors">
    Every Frosh Week takes months of planning and wouldn't be possible without the CSSS executives
    and volunteers. There is one last piece to making Frosh a success: sponsors.
    <br /><br />

    If you're interested in sponsoring this event, please email csss-froshchair@sfu.ca.
    <Fragment slot="footer">
      <Button href="mailto:csss-froshchair@sfu.ca">Frosh Chair</Button>
    </Fragment>
  </Section>
  <Faq />
</Layout>
